        <div class="accordion-item " style="display:none;" >
      <div class="accordion-header"><span class="fa fa-id-card-o type"></span> <span class="title">Voter Registration</span> <i class="ico"></i> </div>
      <div class="accordion-content"><h3 id="versionHeadLine"><em>Voter Registration</em></h3>

<p><a aria-label="https://www.ok.gov/elections/Voter_Info/Register_to_Vote/index.html Opens in new window" href="https://oklahoma.gov/elections/voter-registration/register-to-vote.html" rel="noopener" target="_blank">https://oklahoma.gov/elections/voter-info/register-to-vote.html</a></p>

<p>Use the above link to view information on the following:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Voter&nbsp;Eligibility</li>
	<li>How to Register</li>
	<li>Changing Your Registration</li>
	<li>Submitting Your Application</li>
	<li>Voter Identification Card</li>
	<li>Closed Primary System</li>
	<li>When to Register</li>
</ul>
 </div>
    </div>
        <div class="accordion-item " style="display:none;" >
      <div class="accordion-header"><span class="fa fa-question type"></span> <span class="title">Interested in Becoming a Precinct Official?</span> <i class="ico"></i> </div>
      <div class="accordion-content"><p><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Precinct Officials perform a valuable community service and ensure that the democratic process is performed with integrity.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">You must be a registered voter in Oklahoma County, have reliable transportation and be available, on election days, from 6:00 am until at least an hour after the last voter has been processed.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">All potential Precinct Officials must attend a mandatory training session.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">If you are interested in becoming an Oklahoma County Precinct Official, please use the following link or QR Code</span></span></p>

<p style="margin:0in">&nbsp;</p>

